# tzhist_world
# collected tzhistory updates for the world except Canada and USA
# last edited 15-mar-22
#
# This information is in the public domain
# 

# A zic extension which understands the keyword 'follow' is used.
# The preprocessor zifollow written by Leszek Buczkowski replaces 'follow' sections
# on the source level, so that it is possible to use unpatched zic.

# Sources for information:
# research by Alois Treindl, Jules Descartes, others named in comments.
# TZ database, comment sections in files Europe and Asia
# Books: 
# Doris Chase Doane, Time Changes in the World, Tempe, AZ (1982)
# Henri le Corré, Régimes horaires pour l?europe et l'Afrique, Paris (1982)
# Gabriel, Traite de l'heure dans le monde, Paris (1991)
# Francoise Schneider Gauquelin, Problèmes de l'heure, Paris (1991)
# Thomas G. Shanks, International Atlas, 5th edition, San Diego (1999)
# A. Tsaitsev & D. Kutalev, Координаты городов и временные поправки, (2005)
# Transl. Title: Astrologer's Handbook. City coordinates and time adjustments

